~ start
set State.in_dialogue = true

Phone: Boss is calling again...
- Answer
	Boss: Wow, You actually did it, You Assassinated Him... Good job.
	Boss: We have wired 1 Million Dollars to your bank account.
	Boss: Nice work.
	set State.finished_final = true
	set State.in_dialogue = false
	=> END
	
set State.finished_final = true
set State.in_dialogue = false
=> END